    "lines": [
     76,
     80
    ],
    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Verifies that 40 genealogically related surname variants all collapse to the same Soundex code B650, demonstrating Soundex's core purpose of grouping phonetically similar names together regardless of spelling."
